---
title: "withdrawExcessInvestedCapital (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: check not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_revert_paused: paused
    q_revert_paused --> [*]: revert Paused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_published: not paused
    q_check_published --> q_check_claimed: results published (merkle root set)
    q_check_published --> q_revert_published: results not published
    q_revert_published --> [*]: revert ResultsNotPublished
    q_check_claimed --> q_verify_proof: position.hasClaimedExcess == false
    q_check_claimed --> q_revert_claimed: already claimed
    q_revert_claimed --> [*]: revert AlreadyClaimed
    q_verify_proof --> q_calc_excess: verify merkle proof against acceptedCapitalMerkleRoot
    q_verify_proof --> q_revert_proof: invalid proof
    q_revert_proof --> [*]: revert InvalidMerkleProof
    q_calc_excess --> q_update: excessAmount = investedCapital - acceptedCapital
    q_update --> q_transfer: position.hasClaimedExcess = true
    q_transfer --> [*]: transfer(investor, excessAmount), emit ExcessCapitalWithdrawn

    note right of q_verify_proof
        INV-001: merkle proof must validate against published acceptedCapitalMerkleRoot
        INV-002: excess = investedCapital - acceptedCapital >= 0
        INV-003: each investor can claim excess at most once
        INV-004: excess withdrawal requires results to be published first
    end note
